### Case: unauthenticated — no Authorization header at all.
### Expect 401. Rejected in the access phase; the upstream is never contacted.
###
### A 302/303/307 here is the signature failure of this solution: unauth_action
### is still at its default "auth", so the gateway is redirecting API clients to
### Okta's HTML login page instead of refusing them.
GET {{GATEWAY}}/posts
accept: application/json
